---
title: Opportunities
layout: "base.njk"

---
<main>
  <section class="card-list">
    <h2>
      A collection of potential research partners
    </h2>
    <p>
      Browse all active research projects, open questions, internships and
      collaboration opportunities. Use filters to refine your search.
    </p>
    <h2>367 opportunities</h2>
    <ul>
      {%- for card in collections.opportunity -%}
        <li>
          {% set layout = card.data.layoutCard or "default" %}
          {% include "cards/" + layout + ".njk" %}
        </li>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ul>
    <div class="loading">
      <p>Loading more opportunities</p>
      <div class="spinner">
        {% include "svgs/logo.njk" %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
